			<div class="content" id="post-content-4367743">
									

<p>Spoilers?</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Drop&nbsp;down&nbsp;dropdown</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Collapse&nbsp;collapsible</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The anomaly is semantic, similarly to <a href="/scp-2565">Allison Eckhart</a> or <a href="/scp-1539">SCP-1539</a>. Anything that passes through is redefined as “sky”. Cognitohazardous and ontokinetic elements are also involved.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>And now for <a href="https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/WildMassGuessing">Wild! Mass! Guessing!</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-426977-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-426977-1')">1</a></sup></p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Drop&nbsp;down&nbsp;dropdown</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Collapse&nbsp;collapsible</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-2348 is a sky deity. This is no mere Zeus/Jupiter or Ra, however. This is a <em>conceptual</em> sky deity. This thing is a physical manifestation of the <em>concept</em> of “sky”. Apparently, this thing is such a powerful manifestation that it redefines objects passing through them to “sky”. It also draws in the sky around it, explaining the sub-anomalies. For the purpose of anyone around it, it <em>is</em> the entire sky. The “hand” imagery is due to human failure of comprehension. 2348 is shaped like a manipulative body part, incomprehensible to humans and rationalized as a hand. The pointing form is due to the manipulative body part moving into a manipulation phase, from the sky taking action. This is basically a sky god as Lovecraft or maybe <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(571081); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=571081&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1568839367" alt="qntm" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=571081)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/qntm" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(571081); return false;">qntm</a></span> would write it. A new addition to the “conceptual pantheon” beside <a href="/scp-3125">f i f t h</a>, god of distortion, and the <a href="/scp-2747">anafabula</a>, god of destruction.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-426977-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-426977-1')">1</a>. To be read like they read <a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wheel_of_Fortune_(American_game_show)">Wheel of Fortune</a> in the intro.</div>
</div>

